{"id":"652045","name":"家常炒牛河","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/652045/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"河粉","amount":"750g"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"200g"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"1颗"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"半截"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"小葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"河粉。","img":"images/652045/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生菜清洗干净后掰成两段。","img":"images/652045/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"牛肉、鸡蛋、胡萝卜、小葱。","img":"images/652045/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋调成液，牛肉用酱油、胡椒粉、淀粉、油，腌制入味。","img":"images/652045/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜切片，小葱切段。","img":"images/652045/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用酱油、老抽、蚝油、胡椒粉、沙茶酱，拌一个酱汁备用。","img":"images/652045/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"起锅热油，把牛肉炒熟，铲出备用。","img":"images/652045/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"鸡蛋滑熟，铲出备用。","img":"images/652045/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中再次放油，炸香葱白。","img":"images/652045/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入胡萝卜片，炒至断生。","img":"images/652045/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入河粉，炒至干香。","img":"images/652045/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"把刚刚炒好的牛肉和鸡蛋倒入翻炒。","img":"images/652045/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入生菜炒至断生。","img":"images/652045/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"把酱汁倒入，翻炒入味。","img":"images/652045/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"最后放入剩下的小葱，翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/652045/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。家常炒牛河。","img":"images/652045/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}